# NetworkPolicy

## 1. Default Deny All

ปิดทุก Traffic ก่อน

```yaml
apiVersion: networking.k8s.io/v1
kind: NetworkPolicy
metadata:
  name: default-deny
spec:
  podSelector: {}
  policyTypes:
  - Ingress
  - Egress
```

---

## 2. Allow Ingress Controller → FastAPI

```yaml
apiVersion: networking.k8s.io/v1
kind: NetworkPolicy
metadata:
  name: allow-nginx
spec:
  podSelector:
    matchLabels:
      app: {{ include "fastapi.name" . }}

  policyTypes:
  - Ingress

  ingress:
  - from:
    - namespaceSelector:
        matchLabels:
          kubernetes.io/metadata.name: ingress-nginx

    ports:
    - protocol: TCP
      port: 8000
```

---

## 3. Allow DNS

ถ้าปิด egress ทั้งหมด Pod จะ Resolve DNS ไม่ได้

```yaml
apiVersion: networking.k8s.io/v1
kind: NetworkPolicy
metadata:
  name: allow-dns
spec:
  podSelector:
    matchLabels:
      app: {{ include "fastapi.name" . }}

  policyTypes:
  - Egress

  egress:
  - to:
    - namespaceSelector:
        matchLabels:
          kubernetes.io/metadata.name: kube-system

    ports:
    - protocol: UDP
      port: 53

    - protocol: TCP
      port: 53
```

---

## 4. Allow PostgreSQL

กรณีใช้ PostgreSQL ใน Cluster

```yaml
apiVersion: networking.k8s.io/v1
kind: NetworkPolicy
metadata:
  name: allow-postgres
spec:
  podSelector:
    matchLabels:
      app: {{ include "fastapi.name" . }}

  policyTypes:
  - Egress

  egress:
  - to:
    - podSelector:
        matchLabels:
          app: postgres

    ports:
    - protocol: TCP
      port: 5432
```

