# ใช้พร้อม Node Distribution

Production มักใส่ 2 Constraint

```yaml
topologySpreadConstraints:

- maxSkew: 1
  topologyKey: topology.kubernetes.io/zone
  whenUnsatisfiable: DoNotSchedule
  labelSelector:
    matchLabels:
      app: {{ include "fastapi.name" . }}

- maxSkew: 1
  topologyKey: kubernetes.io/hostname
  whenUnsatisfiable: ScheduleAnyway
  labelSelector:
    matchLabels:
      app: {{ include "fastapi.name" . }}
```

---

# Helm Values

```yaml
topologySpread:
  enabled: true

  zone:
    enabled: true
    maxSkew: 1

  node:
    enabled: true
    maxSkew: 1
```

